  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c8d1a109e3f4550607082930a1a2b3c4, type: 3}
  m_Name: intro_cyclotron
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: MobileIdleBuilder::MobileIdleBuilder.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Your second prestige has charged the Cyclotron. Open it from the menu.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: Kick the particle each time it crosses the gap. Every good kick adds energy
      and widens its orbit. You have 30 seconds.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: The energy you reach multiplies everything your factory earns, from one
      and a half to three times, for a few minutes. Each run also pays Insight, which
      makes the boost last longer or recharge faster.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: It needs an hour to recharge at first. Fire it when your factory is running
      at its best.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
